{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：22:00 2026-09-14 HKT</p>\n\n<p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》引起全城話題，其中26歲中葡芬混血冷氣師傅方智弘（Oscar），憑精緻五官、陽光笑容及一對麒麟臂一夜爆紅。日前網上流傳Oscar於節目中被Foul出局，消息一出隨即引發網民熱烈討論。有網民為他大抱不平，留言揚言：「無佢就唔睇啦。」亦有觀眾質疑節目有劇本：「女神都係收order做嘢，轉頭可能喺藝員科見到佢呢。」</p>\n<h2>傳Oscar被叮走全民嘆可惜</h2>\n<p>有現實派網民認為女神選擇相當合理，留言：「可能只係靚仔，但無錢呢，所以咪foul囉」、「好簡單，收入低囉，你估班女神會接受咩？」更有網民分析指職業是硬傷：「咁靚仔會冇安全感、因為會有好多桃花，基本上佢哋都唔會揀一個安裝同維修冷氣嘅人做老公，生活冇保障，有冇樓同年薪幾多先係重點！」就在全城鬧得沸沸揚揚之際，有網民發文「出局」純屬美麗的誤會：「Oscar真係參賽者中最靚仔！就係Bob之前喺記者會放嗰張抱住參賽者嘅相，話一個極優質參賽者因一啲事差啲被FOUL，最後幸好都留得低，所以阿Bob好激動攬住佢！」根據髮型及衣著，證實Oscar並未止步，有驚無險。</p>\n<img alt=\"26歲混血靚仔冷氣師傅方智弘（Oscar）獲得關注。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3a1fcaba5c26d35bebc586936abf6af/2026-09/03_1_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘擁有葡萄牙、芬蘭及香港血統，是一名冷氣師傅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9665c836290285771c588d978c911b45/2026-09/07_3_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘評判要求下，他大方展露麒麟臂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddb366f4ccc3f187449f00c086748982/2026-09/08_5_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘大方展露麒麟臂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83055bd04c337432b9ac6daf21a5909c/2026-09/10_0_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民分享阿Bob與Oscar相擁的照片，指Oscar最後成功入圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c849039a6945d4ef447b79bb42507d48/2026-09/801785680_122204359484768100_4988577861138349739_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Oscar近日傳出被淘汰，網民即洗板式嘆可惜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f9d713247c1317693c81de46f827ba5/2026-09/805958905_122204359442768100_602699185397293868_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Oscar方智弘表示要於凌晨5時半開工。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a92b4025dc1af80baad12f6bfbba39a/2026-09/Oscar_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Oscar方智弘被指開工洗冷氣時會戴口罩。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/712729e3a60c8e2e13916d0f56d51aa4/2026-09/Oscar_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Oscar方智弘洗冷氣照片。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba57be5c270b127f345e5e6ec42dac07/2026-09/Oscar_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Oscar方智弘洗冷氣的開工照被公開。（Threads圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa8fb4f97177bea4e18e3902ae14ccc6/2026-09/Oscar_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Oscar方智弘昔日洗冷氣時未有露出真面目。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb66fe82c1010856e615b124f18adf2a/2026-09/Oscar_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民公開曾經跟Oscar方智弘開工的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68eecb205638d828129235da8624750b/2026-09/Oscar_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民跟Oscar方智弘開工的情況。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7799feb3171e32cdf060babeca9d428/2026-09/CAP6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"前老闆大讚Oscar方智弘做事肯學肯拼、從不偷懶曠工。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8cea0c876a43d0726f64a5eb9d97c6d/2026-09/cap2_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘（Oscar）與賀邦（Bronny）以二人男子組合「OneUp」正式出道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9e8f36d96d5a42dd2491e98d72ce723/2024-07/Image_3_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Bronny（左）和Oscar（右）在歌曲〈Ten Outta Ten〉MV中，化身深情王子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5b09703ec393b920c712e2442d786768/2024-07/Image_7_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘在節目上表示已經從事冷氣工作長達7、8年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0d865b9a5395b6148bb8330a523737c/2026-09/17_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘還擅長髹油漆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/19de0a6975b3f9343cdf088cd743959e/2026-09/18_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民發現方智弘原來早在2023年已參加ViuTV的《全民造星V》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d969aa10a943defeecda70e7413daee/2026-09/001_1_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘在首輪已被淘汰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/787779df500a33c9369cfee4950c43ec/2026-09/002_1_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘曾加入樂壇發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5409ca573f5a76d5a56faf3af329112a/2026-09/19_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Oscar自爆初戀亦曾好像歌曲故事般，不顧一切地愛對方。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dd179ad409a7f2a3338d91b7217c4d5c/2024-07/Image_8_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘曾於《2024年度叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》獲得「叱咤樂壇生力軍組合歌手銅獎」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ffd91b6333aff6c077e533c709a68b2/2026-09/VS--YouTube-6089OneUpROVERVIVAsimCreditCard2024-YouTube-2_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘私底下原來是一名「吃貨」，經常在社交平台分享美食照。。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73eb8eda279e46ad851a10c03dfbbb85/2026-09/20_0_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘好似吳偉豪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/563b65586c9f51a8d9d25bafb67a8e7e/2026-09/21_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘十分鍾情香港本土情懷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a76102caaa3d2014eb0d1d6619b01b19/2026-09/22_0_4.jpg\"/>\n<h2>Oscar早憑參加《全民造星V》出道</h2>\n<p>Oscar方智弘曾於2023年參加ViuTV《全民造星V》，雖在首輪止步，但其後與賀邦（Bronny）組成男團OneUp出道，推出過〈Ten Outta Ten〉等多首派台歌，更曾奪得《2024年度叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》「叱咤樂壇生力軍組合歌手銅獎」。雖然一度因藝人身分惹來扮素人質疑，主持阿Bob亦公開力撐他，為了追夢兼職打拼值得尊重。如今Oscar成功化險為夷有得留低，絕對是下一集的焦點所在。</p>\n<img alt=\"俞可程分享了一輯超性感寫真。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5324f60c4a06c34a85dc10e44de5f30a/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785688_3645401024577600870_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程在相中大晒美好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbf958363f4b33e5379ad0c3e2b00a04/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785688_3645401024711722297_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程五官標緻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4644e36846233ad969d8607b9ecf985d/2025-06/kanissyu_1739451550_3567100606596996838_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程不時在IG分享靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e51913b007a056e4eea608111ae9034/2025-06/kanissyu_1739451550_3567100606773169888_513264431_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程是2024年的港姐十強。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89a98adfd30eec60fd29b25fa9dc7908/2025-06/kanissyu_1738119049_3555922774558631971_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程樣子甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/524fca76093f3aa4c7426827686759ad/2025-06/kanissyu_1738119049_3555922774399373748_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程運動裝都非常性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f9b165c24a1a4deccb1ad9892a58405/2025-06/VS--KanisYukanissyuInstagram-0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程經常派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e43490e807c231c956f9dda64be786d/2025-06/kanissyu_1740456467_3575530457682944826_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程經常晒長腿性感示人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d978d0d542ef6e696046dd0996d3d36/2025-06/kanissyu_1740800970_3578420362138437530_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程在今年1月生日，在IG分享靚相向粉絲派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57563646de24b05dffb715bfac381b82/2026-02/kanissyu_1767360721_3801219702118804121_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程身材fit爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ba2caf174aee0ccb5d28e0d1def0da5/2026-02/kanissyu_1767360721_3801219702445962550_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程展露出其招牌甜美笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2f8b89ea29515a90b1ed4f6898ccec5/2026-02/kanissyu_1769656568_3820478193438159445_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程在酒店房間以不同角度自拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93c19fc32cb9ce830132f603539d164d/2026-02/kanissyu_1769656568_3820478197095537668_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程被網民讚有仙氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a2349229eec3e06eb7eb873115abdc6e/2026-02/kanissyu_1769656568_3820478198756495787_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程高角度自拍，展露了其白滑的大腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/161fe9f7afe6f484cc032c05a0d6d20c/2026-02/kanissyu_1769656568_3820478201273057865_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程晒性感健身靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d0da833545655474f63fe7bb07478f1/2025-12/1_10_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程身材一流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b807b5e3d825679d42c8be98dd3873cf/2025-12/2_12_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程自拍作胸部大特寫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab45420ca0becd5b56370e8b62a2a70e/2025-12/3_11_27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程的咬唇動作好誘人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/455584acdf9ef87a19bb848319e6043f/2025-12/4_10_37.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程青春迫人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a45d8b4f38349a604b639b77b7defa7/2025-12/5_10_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程是東張性感女神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3fb7f9c0550b14527b7dedc6e7a1a39b/2025-12/6_7_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程穿上透視上衣，令內衣若隱若現。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22dc4b4a6862572c2a342694f3e015ce/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785688_3645401024720223006_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程坐在廚房中島上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f89e392957027ad0e6f1a7454508171d/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785688_3645401024795515297_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程大晒纖腰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7fe72adae0245f0354bb41e3685fd6d4/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785688_3645401024929829344_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程擁有一雙長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d41faee85b30948565159101f073a615/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785687_3645401024585826590_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程在新相中大晒一副好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74c518372a0213d11c53285f43cfd068/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785688_3645401024711652205_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程新相超性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a79dc9d74590e12019854e0e99be40b/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785688_3645401024862729059_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程彎腰擺出迷人甫士。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/738d9a592a727ad212969f63f4953c01/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785688_3645401024871193080_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程這輯相引起網民熱議。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c126ba9866bd914a97e84094d467115/2025-06/kanissyu_1748785688_3645401024971895525_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程於長隆浸溫泉大騷豐滿上圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f53f919f41ea3e8bd9107925e95466e6/2025-10/3_9_17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程非常性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7f8718e20d964c2f38e3a12d3bc096f/2025-10/4_8_31.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程十分吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85bda59837f0f5f0adcb8b1c2585c137/2025-10/5_8_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程烏手一夾，春光無限。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3dd3b5f43281819cfa5cd7c0620eaee4/2025-10/6_6_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程身材一流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e80e811b7ef6f27218b9f9b65016e12/2025-10/7_8_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「東張女神」俞可程後來要接受第二次手術，重鋪角膜瓣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b274a757ffaa9d221332430e5e293e5/2025-10/kanissyu_1759481492_3735123937999299931_513264431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程（Kanis）參選港姐，三圍是33.5 23 35。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bdda896c3626337ab859159af9e56e9a/2024-08/Image_22_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程Kanis參選時給人一種陽光健康的感覺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a3f5632b4673441ea9ac462283b0dd4/2024-07/kakaotalk_20240715_171927774_13.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T14:19:47.080675+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":711,"images":63,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}